+fake adapter identity to already read as non-synthetic (for example, a second
+suite that also drives real evidence through `queueOwnedVoiceGenome`), move
+this relabel into the shared file itself (an added, opt-in parameter to
+`createFakeProcessingAdapters(options)`, never a change to its unconditional
+default) and delete the local wrapper here in the same commit.
